in the exciting world of personalized apparel and lifestyle products!</span></p><p><span style="color:#121317">As we continue to expand our business, we are seeking a curious and passionate individual to join our team as </span><strong><span style="color:#121317">(Senior) Web Analyst (f/m/d)</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;and drive our business forward.&nbsp;</span></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317"><br>What Will Your Role Be<br></span></strong></h3><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">We're looking for a Senior Web Analyst to own and evolve our digital measurement ecosystem. You'll help us understand how millions of users interact with our digital products and turn that understanding into better product and business decisions. You'll work at the intersection of Product, Marketing and Engineering, ensuring that our tracking is accurate, scalable and future-proof. From defining measurement strategies to implementing tracking solutions and uncovering actionable insights, you'll play a key role in improving our digital products and customer experience.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">This is not a generic Data Analytics or Data Science role. We're looking for someone with a strong background in Web Analytics, Digital Analytics, Marketing Analytics or Product Analytics who enjoys solving real business problems through reliable data.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">What You’ll Do&nbsp;<br></span></strong></h3><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Own Digital Measurement</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Own and continuously improve our digital measurement landscape across multiple digital products</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Design, implement and optimise client-side and server-side tracking solutions</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ensure accurate, scalable and privacy-compliant data collection</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Drive Measurement Strategy</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Translate business questions into measurement concepts and technical tracking requirements</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Define KPIs and success metrics together with Product, Marketing and business stakeholders</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Develop tracking specifications for new products, features and customer journeys</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Generate Insights</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Analyse user behaviour, customer journeys and conversion funnels</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Build dashboards and reporting solutions that enable data-informed decision making</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Identify optimisation opportunities and provide actionable recommendations</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Experiment and Optimise</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Design, implement and evaluate A/B tests and experimentation initiatives</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Measure the impact of new features, campaigns and product improvements</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Continuously improve tracking quality, measurement standards and analytics processes</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Collaborate Across Teams</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Work closely with Product Managers, Engineers and Marketing teams</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Present analytical findings in a clear and actionable way to both technical and non-technical stakeholders</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Help establish analytics best practices across the organisation</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">What You’ll Bring<br></span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Several years of experience in Web Analytics, Digital Analytics, Marketing Analytics or Product Analytics</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Hands-on experience with modern tracking implementations and digital measurement architectures</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Practical experience with tag management systems such as Adobe Experience Platform Tags or Google Tag Manager</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with Adobe Analytics, Google Analytics 4 or comparable enterprise analytics platforms</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Solid knowledge of JavaScript and experience with SQL and/or Python</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with client-side and server-side tracking</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Strong analytical thinking combined with a pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A solid understanding of data quality, tracking validation and analytics governance</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Confidence working independently while collaborating closely with cross-functional teams</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Excellent written and spoken English</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Nice to Have</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with Product Analytics platforms</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with Looker Studio, Power BI or Tableau</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with BigQuery, Snowflake or similar cloud data environments</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience with experimentation platforms</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Knowledge of privacy regulations and consent management</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Experience in e-commerce or digital consumer products</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why Should You Join Us</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Autonomy and Impact:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;We believe in giving people real ownership. You'll have the freedom to make decisions, take action, and see the direct impact of your work on the business.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Development and Growth:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;We believe that the greatest professional and personal growth happens when you're challenged. If you're looking to build your career, you'll find plenty of opportunities to do so.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">We Win as a Team:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">Work alongside ambitious, motivated colleagues who challenge and support each other to achieve exceptional results. Through honest feedback, high standards, and shared ambition, we bring out the best in one another.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Learn from Proven Entrepreneurs:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Work closely with experienced founders and business leaders, gaining first-hand insights into growing a successful international company.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Transparency and Involvement:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Stay connected to our vision through regular General Assemblies, learn about our processes in our production sites in the Czech Republic and join workshops and cross function initiatives to lead positive change.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">The Extras That Matter:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Enjoy 30 days of paid vacation, attractive employee discounts on our products and partner brands, modern office spaces designed for collaboration, and regular company events where we celebrate our successes together.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Equal Opportunity Employer</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#121317">We value diversity at Spread Group. We are proud of and continue to encourage the increasing diversity of our company culture and community. Your skills, talents, and experience are our focus no matter your age, ethnicity, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, marital or disability status.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h2></h2><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/spread-group/senior-web-analyst-leipzig-435353","tags":["Digital & Consumer Analytics"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Leipzig, Sachsen, Germany","created_at":1795836684},{"slug":"senior-data-engineer-berlin-334230","company_name":"Arsipa GmbH","title":"Senior Data Engineer (w/m/d)","description":"<figure><img style="width:891px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/oo12w6nbw2r8ylpk4mr7nh9y1au83e/image.png"></figure><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#022642">Du möchtest moderne Datenplattformen entwickeln, skalierbare Datenarchitekturen gestalten und die datengetriebene Weiterentwicklung einer wachsenden Unternehmensgruppe aktiv vorantreiben? Dann suchen wir Dich zum nächstmöglichen Zeitpunkt als:</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#3eb9c0">Senior Data Engineer (w/m/d)</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#022642">Als Senior Data Engineer (w/m/d) übernimmst Du eine zentrale Rolle beim Aufbau und der Weiterentwicklung unserer gruppenweiten Datenplattform. Du entwickelst stabile und skalierbare Datenpipelines, stellst eine hohe Datenqualität sicher und schaffst die technische Grundlage für datenbasierte Entscheidungen. Dabei arbeitest Du eng mit unseren Analytics-, Product- und Engineering-Teams zusammen und gestaltest die Weiterentwicklung unserer Datenarchitektur und Datenstrategie aktiv mit.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#022642">Die </span><strong><span style="color:#022642">Arsipa Gruppe</span></strong><span style="color:#022642"> ist eine schnell wachsende, PE-backed Unternehmensgruppe im Bereich Health, Safety &amp; Environment, unterstützt von Warburg Pincus. Mit über 1.000 Mitarbeitenden, 20+ Tochtergesellschaften und 90 Standorten in Deutschland und Österreich bauen wir im Rahmen einer klaren Buy-&amp;-Build-Strategie eine skalierbare Plattform mit nachhaltiger Wertschöpfung. Unser Ziel: eine der führenden Anbieterinnen im deutschsprachigen Markt - unterstützt durch zentrale Funktionen wie Finance, People, Marketing und IT am Standort Berlin.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#3eb9c0">Deine Aufgaben:</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#022642">Datenplattform &amp; Architektur</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Den Aufbau, Betrieb und die Weiterentwicklung unserer skalierbaren Datenplattform auf Basis moderner Warehouse-, Data-Lake- oder Lakehouse-Architekturen verantwortest Du eigenständig.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Robuste ETL- und ELT-Pipelines zur Integration unterschiedlicher Datenquellen entwickelst, optimierst und wartest Du kontinuierlich.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Moderne Datenarchitekturen und Datenmodelle gestaltest Du mit Blick auf Performance, Skalierbarkeit und eine effiziente Verarbeitung großer Datenmengen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Bestehende Datenarchitekturen analysierst und optimierst Du hinsichtlich Stabilität, Wirtschaftlichkeit und zukünftiger Anforderungen.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#022642">Data Engineering &amp; Quality Management</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Die Qualität, Konsistenz und Verfügbarkeit unserer Daten stellst Du durch geeignete Validierungs-, Test- und Monitoring-Prozesse sicher.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Automatisierte Datenprozesse und zuverlässige Workflows entwickelst Du und unterstützt damit eine effiziente und skalierbare Datenverarbeitung.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Monitoring-, Governance- und Sicherheitskonzepte implementierst Du unter Berücksichtigung geltender Datenschutzanforderungen, insbesondere der DSGVO.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Technische Herausforderungen identifizierst Du frühzeitig, entwickelst nachhaltige Lösungsansätze und optimierst bestehende Datenpipelines kontinuierlich.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#022642">Zusammenarbeit &amp; Datenstrategie</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Eng arbeitest Du mit unseren Analytics-, Product- und Engineering-Teams zusammen und unterstützt die Umsetzung datengetriebener Anforderungen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Fachliche und technische Anforderungen übersetzt Du in skalierbare Datenlösungen und sorgst für eine transparente Abstimmung mit den relevanten Stakeholdern.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#022642">Die Weiterentwicklung unserer gruppenweiten Datenstrategie gestaltest Du aktiv mit und evaluierst