uted systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to communicate technical ideas clearly and collaborate across engineering and product teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with data ingestion pipelines, streaming platforms, or object storage is a plus.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Perks</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible work environment</strong> - ClickHouse is a globally distributed company and remote-friendly. We currently operate in over 25 countries.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Healthcare</strong> - Employer contributions towards your healthcare.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Equity in the company</strong> - Every new eligible team member who joins our company receives equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Time off</strong> - Flexible time off in the US, generous entitlement in other countries.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A USD$500 Home office setup </strong>if you’re a remote employee.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global Gatherings </strong>– We believe in the power of in-person connection and offer opportunities to engage with colleagues at company-wide offsites.</p></li></ul><h3>Culture - We All Shape It</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">As part of a rapidly scaling start-up, you will be instrumental in shaping our culture.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are you interested in finding out more about our culture? Learn more about our values <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://clickhouse.com/company/careers">here</a>. Check out our<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://clickhouse.com/blog"> blog posts</a> or follow us on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/clickhouseinc/life/0c1ee7f4-2129-488d-b413-e7f6270659fd/?viewAsMember=true">LinkedIn</a> to find out more about wha