e provide benefits according to local country norms.*</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>US: </strong>Company-paid short-term and long-term disability insurance, plus life insurance to support you and your loved ones.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Career growth</strong> 📈 – We hire rising stars who grow with us! You’ll get €1K (or equivalent) per year to spend on courses, books, events, or coaching to level up your skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A passionate team</strong> 🤩 – We love our product, and we prove it with regular hackathons where we see who can build the coolest thing with it!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remote-first</strong> 🌏 – Our team works remotely across Europe, with regular off-sites for team bonding. Some roles, like sales in the US, are hybrid—please check the job description.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Giving back</strong> 🤝 – We're big fans of open source, and you'll get $100 per month to support projects you care about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transparency</strong> 🙏 – We all know what everyone’s working on, how the company is doing—the whole shebang.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>*Country and/or State specific details provided in your employment agreement.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/n8n/partner-manager-mea-apac-germany-362046","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Germany","created_at":1795815614},{"slug":"group-product-manager-ai-experience-germany-117123","company_name":"N8N","title":"Group Product Manager - AI Experience","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The AI orchestration of your wildest imagination.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">n8n is the open workflow orchestration platform built for the new era of AI. We give technical teams the freedom of code with the speed of no-code, so they can automate faster, smarter, and without limits. Backed by a fiercely inventive community and 500+ builder-approved integrations, we’re changing the way people bring systems together and scale ideas for impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Since our founding in 2019, we’ve grown into a diverse team of over 260 - working across Europe and the US, connected by a shared builder spirit and with our centre of gravity in Berlin. Along the way, we’ve:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cultivated a community of more than 650,000 active developers and builders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Earned 190K+ GitHub stars, making us one of the world’s Top 40 most popular projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top investors, from Sequoia’s first German seed to our SAP's recent strategic investment - bringing us to a $5.2bn valuation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />That’s the company we’ve built. Now we’d love to see what <em>you </em>can build. If you’re applying, try n8n out - whether you’re technical or not - and share a screenshot of your first workflow with us. The easiest place to start is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your main goal will be to lead n8n's AI Experience group: the teams that shape how people build agents and workflows with AI, how they come to trust what they've automated, and how n8n grows into a self-healing, self-improving platform.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll lead the PMs behind the AI Assistant, Agents and AI Trust across four areas:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead and grow a team of PMs</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the PMs of the AI Experience group (today AI Assistant, Agents and AI Trust), owning hiring, performance and career growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build PMs who make strong decisions on their own, so the group doesn't depend on you or other leaders to decide.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raise the bar for product craft across the group as the team and its scope grow.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Set the direction for AI Experience</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set a clear strategy across three themes: building great agents and workflows with AI, helping users trust their automations, and evolving n8n into a self-healing, self-improving platform.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make considered bets, decide what not to do, and keep the roadmap ambitious but achievable with Engineering and Design leadership.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Give your teams clear missions that fit the bigger picture of n8n, and stay close to the other product groups (Capabilities, Enterprise and later Platform) as priorities shift.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Stay hands-on</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use the product every day, talk to the people building with it, and form your own view.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Co-shape work with your PMs: probe their thinking, challenge assumptions and course-correct where needed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Engineering, Design and Data so the group delivers its outcomes consistently.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Improve how n8n builds products</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape how PMs, designers and engineers work together in an AI-native org where engineers take on more decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improve product and engineering ways of working across n8n, starting with your own group.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring in go-to-market, Security, Legal, Finance, Developer Relations and model providers where decisions cross over.</p></li></ul><h3>REQUIREMENTS</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Must-haves</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>PM leadership:</strong> You've managed at least two PMs and stayed hands-on with their work, and you can point to people who got better under you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product craft:</strong> You have sharp product sense, think in systems and can turn a vague problem into something concrete.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI fluency:</strong> You use AI heavily in your own work, have built something with agents (a prototype counts) and know evals and harnesses well enough to probe your PMs on them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Group-level strategy:</strong> You've set direction for a product group spanning several products and teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Process mindset:</strong> You improve how product and engineering work together, and you're comfortable with engineers owning more decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Influence without authority:</strong> You align Engineering, Design and peer groups through clarity and trust.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI products in production:</strong> You've shipped AI or agent products to real users, ideally with evals running in production.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical users:</strong> You've built for people who write code or workflows, or worked in an open-source ecosystem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Startup pace:</strong> You've worked in a fast-growing, remote-first startup and enjoy the entrepreneurial side of it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Org change:</strong> You've led a product team through scaling or restructuring.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Technical skills:</strong> You can read code, query data with SQL or prototype with agents.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll lead our AI Experience group as its first dedicated GPM, and build it from here: the PMs, the strategy and how the teams work. We're hiring you to make the calls, so most product decisions in the group will sit with you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The problems are hard and mostly unsolved. Helping people build agents they can rely on, getting them to trust automations that run without anyone watching, and turning n8n into a platform that spots and fixes its own failures are all open questions. You'll get fast, honest feedback on every bet from a fair-code community of 115k+ members and 207k+ GitHub stars.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll also help work out what product leadership looks like when engineers take on more of the decisions. That's still taking shape at n8n, and you'll have a real hand in it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're growing fast. We hit $100M ARR in 2026, and SAP's strategic investment in May valued n8n at $5.2B, more than double our Series C valuation seven months earlier. We're aiming to build a trillion-dollar company, and AI Experience is central to getting there.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're remote-first and async by default, and you'll work with people who care a lot about what they build and are easy to work with.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want to lead the AI core of n8n, we'd like to hear from you!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>n8n is an equal opportunity employer and does not discr