r us, there is no 'too bold' or 'too early'. Just founders venturing into the unknown.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">The role</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">As our Finance Manager, you'll run the day-to-day of Atlantic's fund finance: across portfolio monitoring, cash flow and invoicing, fund accounting and reporting, compliance, and special projects. You'll report directly to our Head of Finance and work closely with our Partners, our fund administrator and our tax advisor.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Beyond the day-to-day, you’ll have a clear mandate to automate. The goal is to cut manual work in half and let portfolio insights surface on their own. If building the finance function of a modern VC sounds better than maintaining one, read on.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you'll own</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Automation.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You develop our existing setup, and automate finance and administrative workflows wherever it adds value.</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Portfolio monitoring.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You collect the reporting from our 150+ portfolio companies and use AI to turn the data into insights that the team can act on.</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Cash flow and invoicing.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You manage liquidity planning, management fees and invoicing across our funds and management company, and support capital calls and distributions.</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Fund accounting and reporting.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You review the work of our fund administrator and support the preparation of quarterly LP reports, annual financial statements and tax filings.</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Compliance.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You keep our funds and management company compliant, from regulatory reporting to KYC/AML checks.</span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Special projects.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You take on ad hoc projects across finance, from new reporting requirements to supporting FX management</span><span style="color:#444746">.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">The mission</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Fast-forward - here's what you've built:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Half the manual work is gone.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Processes that used to eat your week now run on their own, because you automated them</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">The portfolio talks back.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> AI pulls the numbers from 150+ startups, spots what's moving and puts it in front of the team before anyone asks</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Portfolio reporting is an end-to-end system.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> One trusted source the whole team relies on</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">The moonshot:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Automating the full path from term sheet to financial statements. Few funds work this way today. We want to be one of the first, and you'd be the one who helps us build it.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">About you</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You'll feel at home here if you:</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Learned finance where the bar is high.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Maybe in fund finance at a VC or PE firm, at a fund administrator, in Big Four audit or advisory, or in a strong controlling team.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Know your accounting inside out</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, and enjoy putting it to work on a fund</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Think AI-first.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Claude is already part of your workday, and anything you do twice, you want to automate</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Love turning data into insight</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, not just reconciling it</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Own your numbers.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You work independently, follow through, and double-check because you care</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Roll up your sleeves.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You're as happy running payments today as building the automation that runs them tomorrow</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Are curious about startups</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, deep tech and the founders building them</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Speak fluent German and English</span></strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Bonus points if you've worked in or around venture capital, or built your own dashboards, BI reports or no-code automations.</span></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/atlanticvc/finance-manager-finance-data-automation-gn-at-atlantic-berlin-65088","tags":["Core Team"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Berlin, Berlin, Germany","created_at":1795804281},{"slug":"werkstudent-it-system-management-it-business-33100-45542","company_name":"OctoGate IT Security Systems GmbH","title":"Werkstudent IT-System-Management / IT & Business (m/w/d)","description":"