d public-sector partners through briefings, training, or industry forums.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You will be a great fit here if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Thrive with high autonomy and minimal oversight</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are highly curious and driven to uncover hidden patterns and connections others overlook</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring deep experience in intelligence analysis and managing uncertainty</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are an experienced OSINT researcher comfortable navigating multiple languages and jurisdictions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have proven expertise or a strong interest in counter-terrorism financing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Combine initiative and collaboration with sharp analytical and research skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Communicate clearly, whether briefing or producing rigorous, evidence-led reports</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work effectively with global teams and stakeholders at all levels</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our ideal candidate has:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in intelligence, threat analysis, financial crime, OSINT or related investigative fields, including work on illicit or terrorist financing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in a senior or highly autonomous role, demonstrating independent judgment and strategic decision-making</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An understanding of cryptoassets, blockchain analysis, and on-chain tracing tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience producing clear, evidence-based intelligence reports for both technical and non-technical audiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Capable of using Python, SQL, or AI-assisted queryin