obert-cookbook#introduction"> <u>Read the DoctoBERT practical guide</u></a> to learn more about how we bring deep AI research into practical healthcare applications.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/"><em> <u>Doctolib Tech site</u></em></a><em>.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Who you are</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Before you read on: if you don't have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You'll be a great fit if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have 6+ years of experience as a software engineer, with significant Python experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have delivered AI products at scale end-to-end, from initial evaluation and launch to iterations based on production results</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply software engineering best practices as standard: automated testing, CI/CD, and DevOps ("you build it, you run it")</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are product-oriented and comfortable guiding your team through tradeoffs between business needs and technical constraints</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Care about code quality and have a rigorous testing culture; enjoy growing the people around you through pair programming and mentoring</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are fluent in English, written and spoken</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>It would be fantastic if you:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have shipped agentic systems in production</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have experience in the medical domain</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>