<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
<p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">SonarQube: The world’s leading AI code review and verification platform.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">SonarQube Foundation Agent: Currently topping the leaderboards for agentic software repair.</span></p>
