<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
<p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">Committed to our customers and community.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Inter, sans-serif;">
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">Obsessed with quality.</span></p>
