height: 1.7em;"></p></div></div><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:center;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ben je klaar om je energie in deze rol te stoppen en je skills een boost te geven? </span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Solliciteer en word lid van ons team!</span></strong><span style="color:#FFFFFF"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center;"><em>Acquisitie naar aanleiding van deze vacature wordt niet op prijs gesteld</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/zwart-techniek-bv/senior-hr-officer-ijmuiden-455368","tags":["Human Resources"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"IJmuiden, Noord-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1795836682},{"slug":"senior-business-development-representative-netherlands-amsterdam-223523","company_name":"Mollie","title":"Senior Business Development Representative - Netherlands","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build with us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Businesses deserve better from finance. Less friction, more freedom. Since 2004, Mollie has been on a mission to make payments and money management effortless for every business in Europe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today, more than 250,000 companies trust our all-in-one platform to get paid, manage money and grow on their terms. Simple, scalable and built with real businesses in mind.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're one of Europe's fastest-growing fintechs, with 950+ Mollies across 14+ locations. Our people make this growth possible. We move fast, build with purpose and care deeply about our customers. Whether you're solving problems, building market-leading products or exploring how AI can make work smarter, you'll have the freedom to create and the trust to deliver.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're ready to grow, shape the future of fintech and join an ambitious, high-performing team, this is the place for you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your impact</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Senior Business Development Representative, you'll play a key role in accelerating Mollie's growth in the Netherlands, building relationships with larger SMB merchants and helping them find the right payment solutions for their businesses.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll take full commercial ownership of your pipeline, combining inbound and outbound sales and managing more complex opportunities with businesses with annual revenue of up to €12M.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Joining an established, high-performing Dutch sales team, you'll bring your commercial expertise, market understanding and independent approach to winning new business, while continuing to grow your expertise in payments and fintech.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll ship</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Generate new business through a roughly 50/50 mix of inbound and outbound sales activities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Independently own the full sales cycle, managing larger and more complex commercial opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead consultative sales conversations, understand merchant needs and position the right payment solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Consistently achieve quarterly sales targets and drive net revenue growth in the Netherlands.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Navigate complex negotiations and stakeholder relationships to convert opportunities into live merchants.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with internal teams to ensure successful merchant onboarding, implementation and go-live.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain accurate sales forecasts, manage a healthy pipeline and actively share your commercial knowledge