color:#5a5f72">Een professionele en ondersteunende werkomgeving waarin nauwkeurigheid en eigenaarschap worden gewaardeerd.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW30513959 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW30513959 BCX8"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Flexibele startdatum, in overleg vast te stellen.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW30513959 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW30513959 BCX8"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Een enthousiast team, inclusief een gratis teamlunch op maandag en maandelijkse borrels.</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">Wij zijn HG!</span></strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Bij HG, een toonaangevend Europees merk in specialistische reinigings- en onderhoudsproducten, geloven we dat een huis een plek moet zijn waar je zorgeloos kunt leven. Met aandacht voor de plek waar je woont en voor de spullen die je omringen. Daarom ontwikkelen wij onze producten zo dat ze veilig doen wat ze beloven.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">De missie van HG is om jou te helpen optimaal van je huis te genieten, zonder je zorgen te maken over wat er mis kan gaan. Dit realiseren wij met onze zeer effectieve, veilige en specialistische reinigingsoplossingen, gecombineerd met deskundig advies.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72"><br>HG doet wat het belooft.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">Nog vragen?</span></strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Onze collega Ilse de Groot (Corporate Recruiter) neemt alle tijd om antwoord te geven. Je kan haar bereiken via de mail </span><u><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ----- ----- style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">Solliciteren naar deze stageplek bij HG?</span></strong><span style="color:#5a5f72">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5a5f72">Dat kan! Solliciteer direct en stuur je CV op.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW202607405 BCX8" style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="color:#5a5f72">Acquisitie naar aanleiding van deze vacature wordt niet op prijs gesteld.</span></em><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/hg-international-bv/stage-sales-key-account-almere-353250","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Student college","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Almere, Flevoland, Nederland","created_at":1795804277},{"slug":"senior-manager-capability-engineering-customer-training-emea-amsterdam-390385","company_name":"databricks","title":"Senior Manager, Capability Engineering & Customer Training, EMEA","description":"&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is experiencing tremendous growth as enterprise organizations transition from evaluating AI to rapidly deploying production-grade AI systems. This role exists to redefine how we enable our largest customers to move faster, activate their data workforces, and convert platform investments into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Manager of Capability Engineering &amp;amp; AI Adoption for EMEA, you will lead two complementary teams: a regional group of Customer Enablement Architects who act as trusted advisors and builder-enablement partners for Databricks’ largest, most complex accounts, and the EMEA Scaled User Programmes team, whose mission is to design and execute broad, high-impact enablement initiatives across the region. Operating at the intersection of technical depth, program strategy, and business outcomes, you will translate advanced product roadmaps into both personalized, just-in-time capability programs and scalable enablement engines that meet customers wherever they are in their modernization and AI adoption journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, coach, and develop an elite regional team of Customer Enablement Architects across EMEA, setting a high standard for technical depth, customer impact, and creative problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability Engineering at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Redesign enterprise enablement workflows, moving away from legacy episodic models to continuous, contextual, and hyper-personalized capability building aligned with customers&#39; modernization curves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adoption &amp;amp; MAU Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with account teams and field leadership to diagnose capability blockers and drive measurable increases in Monthly Active Users (MAU) across strategic enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Builder Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate a builder culture within the team to design and deploy custom enablement applications, tools, and prototypes (e.g., via Databricks Apps, Genie, or agentic frameworks) when standard curricula fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Stakeholder Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep discovery sessions with enterprise technical leaders and C-suite executives, aligning strategic capability roadmaps with the customer&#39;s high-level AI transformation goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Operational Integrity:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the regional voice into global curriculum and certification teams to prioritize EMEA market needs and skill gaps, while maintaining strict operational rigor with training logistics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Regional Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Undertake regional travel across EMEA to engage directly with strategic enterprise accounts on-site , lead high-stakes executive alignment sessions , and provide hands-on leadership to a geographically dispersed team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep foundational understanding of lakehouse architecture, data engineering/ETL pipelines, data governance, and generative AI/agentic workflows to earn immediate respect from customer data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Builder Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A non-negotiable track record of personally designing, building, and deploying working prototypes, automation tools, or technical apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Facing Solutioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience in a solutions architect, customer success engineering, customer enablement, or advanced delivery role, with a proven ability to confidently navigate ambiguity and discover core user friction points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement Reinvention:&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for moving beyond legacy classroom-style or completion-centric learning models into just-in-time, contextual capability building embedded directly in user workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Business Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to connect technical skill outcomes to core P&amp;amp;L levers, influence renewals/expansions, and collaborate effectively with sales on strategic account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA Fluency &amp;amp; Mobility (Required)&lt;/strong&gt;: Lived experience operating across EMEA markets . Ability and willingness to travel to meet customers and support team members across different EMEA locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership and Credibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience leading and managing technical or customer-facing engineering teams, with a proven ability to mentor talent, hold a high bar, and build a cohesive team identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/databricks/senior-manager-capability-engineering-customer-training-emea-amsterdam-390385","tags":["Education & Training"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1795794924},{"slug":"account-executive-payments-existing-merchants-amsterdam-175615","company_name":"Lightspeedhq","title":"Account Executive, Payments (Existing Merchants)","description":"<h2><strong>Account Executive, Payments (Existing Merchants)</strong></h2><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3><strong>Hi there! Thanks for stopping by 👋</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are you actively looking for a new opportunity? Or just checking the market? Well… you might be in the right place!</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for an Account Executive, Payments, who  is responsible for driving the adoption of Lightspeed Payments within Lightspeed's existing merchant base in the Netherlands. This is a dedicated cross-sell/upsell position focused on transitioning current Point of Sale (POS) customers to our proprietary, integrated payment processing solution.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lightspeed Payments has been continually invested into since launch in 2019, integrating a number of unique value drivers into the combined POS-payments solution.  Building off of success our new business teams have experienced in selling the combined POS-payments solution, we are scaling our ability to sell payments into our existing merchant base, many of which became clients before we scaled Lightspeed Payments.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">This position reports to the Global Payments Sales Manager and is part of the Global Payments GTM team.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h3><strong>Your Mission</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">The primary responsibility is to meet and exceed sales targets for Lightspeed Payments adoption among existing merchants.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pipeline Management:</strong> Generate and manage sales opportunities using leads sourced from Account Managers, direct phone/email outreach, and follow-up on company-led marketing campaigns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sales Execution:</strong> Manage the complete sales cycle from initial qualification and value presentation through pricing negotiation and contract closure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer Launch:</strong> Partner with Onboarding teams to ensure a smooth transition and launch for merchants adopting Lightspeed Payments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Internal Expertise:</strong> Serve as the internal Subject Matter Expert (SME) on payment processing for other units, providing guidance and training as required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product Feedback:</strong> Collect and relay merchant feedback regarding the payments product to the Product Management teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Reporting:</strong> Maintain accurate records of all sales activities, pipeline status, and opportunity notes in Salesforce</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Other Duties:</strong> Handle additional duties and responsibilities as defined by management.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><h3><strong>What you’ll be bringing to the team</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Payments Experience:</strong> Direct experience (3+ years) in the payment processing industry.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sales Closing Role:</strong> Demonstrated experience (3+ years) in a closing role focused on technology or solution sales.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Opportunity Development:</strong> Proven ability to proactively generate and qualify new opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Target Achievement:</strong> Documented history of success in a revenue target or quota-based environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Communication:</strong> Excellent written and verbal communication skills in Dutch language skills are a requirement.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What’s in it for you?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Genuine career growth opportunities based on performance within a company that's continuously expanding</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with highly skilled people who are as passionate about sales &amp; marketing  as you are</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An environment that encourages initiatives and leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work in a team big enough for growth but lean enough to make a real impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fun activities with your teammates &amp; social events throughout the year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Opportunity to learn, expand your skill set, forge wonderful relationships and make your mark within the diverse and inclusive Lightspeed culture, a true Canadian tech success story</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">... and further </p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lightspeed equity scheme (we are all owners)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health &amp; Wellness Credit- expense up to 400 EUR per year towards your gym membership, yoga classes, a new bike or whatever else you do for your health</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mental Health Support through the Modern Health App- whether it is meditation, coaching or counseling you need - each employee gets access to this platform</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">People Experience - Our PX benefit allows you to work from pretty much anywhere in the world for 60 days a year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Time off to volunteer and give back to your community</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Healthy snacks and after work organized by the company</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>To all recruitment agencies: Lightspeed does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. If we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy, Lightspeed will not be responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Lightspeed is a proud equal opportunity employer and we are committed to creating an inclusive and barrier-free workplace. Lightspeed welcomes and encourages applications from people with disabilities. Accommodations are available on request for candidates taking part in all aspects of the selection process.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Where to from here?</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Obviously, this has to be mutually beneficial: we want you to step into a role you love, and we want to offer you a place you’re proud to come to every day. For a glimpse into our world check out our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.lightspeedhq.com/careers/">career page here</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lightspeed is building communities through commerce, and we need people from all backgrounds and lived experiences to do that. We were founded in 2005, in Montreal’s gay village and our original members were all part of the LGBTQ+ community. The ethos of our business has been about inclusion from the very beginning, and we strive to provide a workplace where everyone belongs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Who we are:</strong> </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Powering the businesses that are the backbone of the global economy, Lightspeed's one-stop commerce platform helps merchants innovate to simplify, scale, and provide exceptional customer experiences. Our cloud commerce solution transforms and unifies online and physical operations, multichannel sales, expansion to new locations, global payments, financial solutions, and connection to supplier networks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded in Montréal, Canada in 2005, Lightspeed is dual-listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: LSPD) and Toronto Stock Exchange (TSX: LSPD). With teams across North America, Europe, and Asia Pacific, the company serves retail, hospitality, and golf businesses in over 100 countries.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lightspeed handles your information in accordance with our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="c-link" href="https://www.lightspeedhq.com/legal/applicant-privacy-statement/">Applicant Privacy Statement</a>.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/lightspeedhq/account-executive-payments-existing-merchants-amsterdam-175615","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1795794015},{"slug":"data-bi-intern-amsterdam-269559","company_name":"Creative Clicks B.V.","title":"Data & BI Intern","description":"<h1>Data &amp; BI Intern</h1><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Amsterdam (Hybrid)</p><p><strong>Work model:</strong> Internship</p><p><strong>Team:</strong> MOVION Data Team</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>About Movion</h2><p>Movion helps digital brands reach and grow audiences through mobile networks around the world. We bring together performance marketing, technology, content and local payment solutions to turn great digital products into successful subscription businesses.</p><p>With more than 16 years of mobile expertise and activity in over 45 markets, we work across everything from user acquisition and creative campaigns to payment integrations and revenue optimisation. We also build and distribute our own digital products in gaming, fitness, learning, sports and entertainment.</p><p>At Movion, you'll join an international, collaborative team where you can take ownership, learn from people across disciplines and see the impact of your work.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>The Role</h2><p>We're looking for a Data &amp; BI Intern to join our growing Data Team.</p><p>This internship offers the opportunity to gain hands-on experience across the full data lifecycle, from report planning and development to data transformation, validation and stakeholder communication.</p><p>You'll work closely with experienced team members on real business projects, helping to build and improve data solutions that support decision-making across the business.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>Job Responsibilities</h2><ul><li><p>Support the planning, development and maintenance of reports and dashboards</p></li><li><p>Assist with end-to-end data solution delivery, from data extraction to visualisation</p></li><li><p>Help identify, investigate and resolve data quality issues</p></li><li><p>Support data validation and testing activities</p></li><li><p>Contribute to automation and data optimisation initiatives</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with stakeholders to understand reporting requirements and business needs</p></li><li><p>Assist in improving existing reporting processes and data workflows</p></li><li><p>Document data structures, reporting logic and processes where required</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h2>Job Requirements</h2><ul><li><p>Currently studying a Bachelor's or Master's degree in a Data, Analytics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics or related field</p></li><li><p>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills</p></li><li><p>Curious mindset and willingness to learn</p></li><li><p>Good communication skills and ability to work with different stakeholders</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working with data and identifying patterns or issues</p></li><li><p>Strong attention to detail</p></li></ul><p>Nice to have:</p><ul><li><p>Experience with SQL</p></li><li><p>Experience with Power BI, Tableau or similar visualisation tools</p></li><li><p>Basic knowledge of Python or other analytical programming languages</p></li><li><p>Interest in data engineering, reporting or business intelligence</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h2>What You'll Learn</h2><ul><li><p>End-to-end data solution delivery</p></li><li><p>SQL and data validation techniques</p></li><li><p>Data visualisation and dashboard development</p></li><li><p>Data transformation and reporting processes</p></li><li><p>Automation and AI applications within data teams</p></li><li><p>Stakeholder management and business communication</p></li><li><p>Exposure to data engineering concepts and data pipelines</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h2>What We Offer</h2><ul><li><p>Hands-on experience working on real business projects</p></li><li><p>Dedicated mentorship and support from the Data Team</p></li><li><p>Exposure to modern analytics, reporting and automation tools</p></li><li><p>A fast-growing international environment with colleagues from 25+ nationalities</p></li><li><p>A culture that values ownership, curiosity and continuous improvement</p></li><li><p>The opportunity to develop practical skills that will support your future career in data and analytics</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Movion is proud to be a diverse and equal-opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religion, gender, national origin, age, sexual orientation, disability, or any characteristic protected by law. Decisions are based solely on job-related factors.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/creative-clicks-bv/data-bi-intern-amsterdam-269559","tags":["Movion"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1795793487},{"slug":"marketing-ai-intern-rotterdam-244860","company_name":"Thermeleon B.V.","title":"Marketing & AI Intern","description":"<h2>Marketing & AI Intern</h2><p><strong>Thermeleon | Internship | The Netherlands</strong></p><h3>About Thermeleon</h3><p>Thermeleon is a technology-driven company working at the intersection of energy, technology and sustainable horticulture. We develop innovative solutions that contribute to a more sustainable greenhouse industry while helping reduce pressure on the electricity grid.</p><p>We are a growing team with big ambitions, and we're looking for someone who wants to help shape how Thermeleon presents itself to the world.</p><h3>The role</h3><p>We're looking for a creative, proactive and tech-savvy Marketing Intern who wants to take ownership and build things from the ground up.</p><p>You'll work on refreshing our brand, developing marketing materials and building our digital marketing infrastructure using modern AI tools such as Claude Code.</p><p>You'll have the opportunity to combine creativity, marketing strategy and technology, while seeing your work directly impact a growing company.</p><h3>What you'll be working on</h3><p><strong>1. Brand Refresh</strong></p><ul><li><p>Help refine and strengthen the Thermeleon brand identity.</p></li><li><p>Develop a consistent visual and communication style.</p></li><li><p>Translate our brand positioning into a compelling brand experience.</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. Marketing Materials</strong></p><ul><li><p>Update and develop our marketing materials, including presentations, brochures, one-pagers and other sales collateral.</p></li><li><p>Create visual content for internal and external communication.</p></li><li><p>Ensure consistency across all marketing touchpoints.</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. Build the Thermeleon Website with Claude Code</strong></p><ul><li><p>Take part in rebuilding and developing the Thermeleon website using Claude Code.</p></li><li><p>Translate ideas and designs into functional web pages.</p></li><li><p>Improve website structure, user experience and content.</p></li><li><p>Explore how AI can accelerate website development.</p></li></ul><p><strong>4. Build a Content Marketing Machine with Claude Code</strong></p><ul><li><p>Help build a scalable content marketing system using AI.</p></li><li><p>Develop workflows for content creation, planning and distribution.</p></li><li><p>Create a content calendar and establish a consistent publishing rhythm.</p></li><li><p>Explore AI-powered tools and automations to make marketing more efficient.</p></li></ul><h3>Who we're looking for</h3><ul><li><p>You're studying Marketing, Communication, Creative Business, Digital Media, or a related field.</p></li><li><p>You're creative, curious and entrepreneurial.</p></li><li><p>You have an interest in AI, technology and digital tools.</p></li><li><p>You're excited about experimenting with tools like Claude Code (coding experience is a plus, but not a requirement).</p></li><li><p>You have an eye for design, branding and visual communication.</p></li><li><p>You take initiative and enjoy turning ideas into reality.</p></li><li><p>You're comfortable working independently and taking ownership of projects.</p></li><li><p>You have excellent communication skills in English.</p></li><li><p>Speaking Dutch is a plus</p></li></ul><h3>What we offer</h3><ul><li><p>A hands-on internship where you'll have real ownership and responsibility.</p></li><li><p>The opportunity to build the marketing foundation of a growing technology company.</p></li><li><p>Freedom to experiment with AI and emerging technologies.</p></li><li><p>A close-knit, ambitious and international team.</p></li><li><p>Plenty of room to learn, experiment and bring your own ideas to life.</p></li><li><p>An internship compensation of €400 per month.</p></li></ul><h3>Interested?</h3><p>We'd love to hear from you!</p><p>Send us your CV and a short introduction explaining why this internship interests you.</p><p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/thermeleon-bv/marketing-ai-intern-rotterdam-244860","tags":["Marketing Assistant"],"job_types":["Zero-hours contract (nul-urencontract/oproepcontract)","worker","no experience required / student"],"location":"Rotterdam","created_at":1795793486},{"slug":"qa-engineer-en-breda-216701","company_name":"YoungOnes","title":"QA Engineer (EN)","description":"<h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">About the role</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">At YoungOnes, you make sure our platform delivers on its promise: stable, reliable and free of surprises for the people who use it every day. As a QA Engineer you don't work at the end of the chain, but right in the middle of our development teams. You think along before any code is written, test smartly where it matters, and act as the bridge between development, product and the rest of the company when it comes to quality. You report to the Teamlead Frontend and work daily with the frontend, mobile and backend teams.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you'll do</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Think along from the start.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You join refinements and help teams see the risks and impact of a feature before they start building;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Choose the right test approach.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Together with the team, you decide per feature what to test automatically, what to test manually, and why;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Build and maintain automated tests.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You set up tests for key platform functionality and keep them reliable;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Manual and exploratory testing.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You go through the app yourself, look for edge cases and find what a script misses;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Central point of contact for bugs.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Bug reports from across the company come to you. You reproduce them, gather all the information a developer needs to get started, and get them ready in Jira with the right priority;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Advise on releases.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You map out risks and give clear advice on the quality of a release;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Provide insight.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You collect test data and show how our software quality is doing;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Keep the balance.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> You help teams weigh fixing bugs against building new features.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you bring</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">A bachelor's level of working and thinking, preferably in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related field;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">At least 2 years of work experience, including at least 1 year as a QA Engineer, Software Tester or Test Automation Engineer;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience setting up and carrying out a test approach and test plans;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience with test automation and test frameworks;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You're comfortable working with AI tools and use them purposefully: to test faster and better, and to set up automated tests;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience working in an Agile/Scrum team and with a bug tracking system, preferably Jira.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You work independently, make decisions in your own work and give advice, whether asked or not;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You're critical and analytical, take initiative and work well with developers, product and business.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Nice to have</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Knowledge of TypeScript/JavaScript and you're comfortable working with code;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You look beyond "does it work?": also at accessibility, speed, security and multilingual support.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience with tests that run automatically on every code change, and you know how to deal with unreliable tests;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You enjoy sharing knowledge and helping colleagues test better;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Experience testing mobile apps.</span><br></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#000000">We're looking for someone who sees quality as something the whole team owns. You don't just perfect your own testing work; you ask yourself what needs to change structurally so the whole team tests better. Our own values guide the way: </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Own it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Say it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Make it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#000000">What we offer</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A gross salary between €3,400 and €4,800 based on full-time employment;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">25 vacation days, 6.5 ADV days and 1 additional holiday per calendar year, based on a 40-hour workweek;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">8% vacation pay, a pension plan, and (if you live more than 10 km from the office) a travel allowance;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">We prioritize mental well-being in collaboration with our partner OpenUp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Great perks such as: a yearly fitness budget, a freshly prepared healthy lunch every day, snacks, bi-weekly afternoon drinks, XL borrels every three months and much more;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/youngones/qa-engineer-en-breda-216701","tags":["Development"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Breda, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1795793486},{"slug":"stage-customer-success-breda-220510","company_name":"YoungOnes","title":"Stage Customer Success","description":"<p><span style="color:#000000">Komt jouw stageperiode eraan en wil je die vervullen met écht een toffe tijd waarin je part of the team bent?</span></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#434343">FUNCTIEOMSCHRIJVING</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">Via ons platform en de bijbehorende app hebben mensen de ultieme vrijheid op het gebied van werk. Zij kunnen zelf bepalen waar, wanneer en voor welk uurtarief ze willen werken. Dit doen zij op freelance-basis voor leuke dagklussen in o.a. de horeca, hospitality en de logistiek. De collega’s uit het team waar je terecht komt, zijn verantwoordelijk voor het relatiebeheer van onze opdrachtgevers. En je raadt het al: jouw rol zal hier aan bijdragen. Een super sociale stage waarbij je volledig meedraait met het team, waar je veel kan leren, maar geheid ook veel kan lachen. Having fun is immers wat ons drijft.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#434343">MAAR WAT ZIJN DIE WERKZAAMHEDEN DAN ZOAL?</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je beantwoordt de mails en vragen in de livechat vanuit opdrachtgevers;</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je schakelt tussen freelancers en bedrijven waar dit nodig is. Jij bent het bruggetje tussen deze twee partijen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je geeft opvolging aan het klantcontact en helpt de opdrachtgever o.a. bij het plaatsen van de klussen en het maken van de eerste matches op ons platform;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je bent een adviespartner richting klanten en zorgt ervoor dat ze op de hoogte zijn van alle features van het platform;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je ondersteunt de Customer Success Managers met diverse taken. Je zult veel van hen leren doordat je nauw samenwerkt.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span style="color:#434343">INS &amp; OUTS OP EEN RIJTJE</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">We hebben plek voor een stagiair(e) vanaf september 2026 voor een periode van - het liefst - 5 maanden. Wil je ons eerder komen vergezellen? Ook mogelijk! Vier dagen ondersteun je het team en een dag per week kan je werken aan een mogelijke studieopdracht.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#434343">JE BENT:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Energiek en flexibel - geen dag is hetzelfde in een scale-up;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ondernemend en proactief; jij ziet kansen en pakt ze;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Sociaal en communicatief sterk. Een goed gesprek (of een praatje bij de koffie) ga jij niet uit de weg;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Vloeiend in het Nederlands en het Engels (op kantoor spreken we voornamelijk Engels).</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span style="color:#434343">WAT WIJ BIEDEN:</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Werken in een groeiende scale- up met uitdagende werkzaamheden en goede begeleiding;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je werkt in een hecht team, met veel energieke mensen (kei gezellig gewoon);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een HBO-waardige stagevergoeding van EUR 450,- per maand per fulltime;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Iedere dag een verse verzorgde lunch op kantoor (geen kleffe boterhammen voor jou dus).</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/youngones/stage-customer-success-breda-220510","tags":[],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Breda, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1795793486},{"slug":"qa-engineer-nl-breda-74273","company_name":"YoungOnes","title":"QA Engineer (NL)","description":"<h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Over de rol</span></strong></h4><p><span style="color:#000000">Bij YoungOnes zorg jij ervoor dat ons platform doet wat het belooft: stabiel, betrouwbaar en zonder verrassingen voor de mensen die het elke dag gebruiken. Als QA Engineer werk je niet aan het eind van de keten, maar middenin onze ontwikkelteams. Je denkt mee vóórdat er code geschreven wordt, test slim waar het telt en bent de brug tussen development, product en de rest van het bedrijf als het om kwaliteit gaat. Je valt onder de Teamlead Frontend en werkt dagelijks samen met de frontend-, mobile- en backendteams.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat ga je doen</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Meedenken vanaf het begin.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je schuift aan bij refinements en helpt teams de risico's en impact van een feature te zien voordat ze gaan bouwen;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">De juiste testaanpak kiezen.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Samen met het team bepaal je per feature wat je automatisch test, wat je handmatig test en waarom;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Geautomatiseerde tests bouwen en onderhouden.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je zet tests op voor belangrijke functies van het platform en houdt ze betrouwbaar;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Handmatig en verkennend testen.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je gaat zelf door de app heen, zoekt naar randgevallen en vindt wat een script mist;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Centraal aanspreekpunt voor bugs.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Bugmeldingen uit het hele bedrijf komen bij jou binnen. Je reproduceert ze, verzamelt alle informatie die een developer nodig heeft om ermee aan de slag te gaan en zet ze met de juiste prioriteit klaar in Jira;</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Adviseren over releases.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je brengt risico's in kaart en geeft een duidelijk advies over de kwaliteit van een release.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Inzicht geven.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je verzamelt testdata en laat zien hoe het met de kwaliteit van onze software gaat.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Balans bewaken.</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Je helpt teams de afweging te maken tussen bugs oplossen en nieuwe features bouwen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat breng je mee</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een hbo-werk- en denkniveau, bij voorkeur in informatica, software engineering of iets vergelijkbaars.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Minimaal 2 jaar werkervaring, waarvan minimaal 1 jaar als QA Engineer, Software Tester of Test Automation Engineer.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ervaring met het opzetten en uitvoeren van een testaanpak en testplannen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ervaring met testautomatisering en testframeworks.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je werkt vlot met AI-tools en zet ze gericht in: om sneller en beter te testen en om geautomatiseerde tests op te zetten.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ervaring met werken in een Agile/Scrum-team en met een bugtrackingsysteem, bij voorkeur Jira.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je werkt zelfstandig, durft knopen door te hakken in je eigen werk en geeft gevraagd en ongevraagd advies.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je bent kritisch en analytisch, neemt zelf initiatief en kunt goed schakelen met developers, product en business.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Pluspunten</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je hebt kennis van TypeScript/JavaScript en kunt zelf goed uit de voeten met code.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je kijkt verder dan "werkt het?": ook naar toegankelijkheid, snelheid, veiligheid en meertaligheid.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je hebt ervaring met tests die automatisch meedraaien bij elke codewijziging, en weet hoe je onbetrouwbare tests aanpakt.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je deelt graag kennis en helpt collega's beter te testen.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Je hebt ervaring met het testen van mobiele apps.</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat we van je verwachten</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We zoeken iemand die kwaliteit ziet als iets van het hele team. Je perfectioneert niet alleen je eigen testwerk, maar vraagt je af wat er structureel moet veranderen zodat het hele team beter test. Onze eigen waarden zijn daarbij leidend: </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Own it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Say it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">, </span><strong><span style="color:#000000">Make it</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#000000">Wat wij bieden</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Een brutosalaris tussen € 3.400 en € 4.800 op basis van een fulltime dienstverband;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">25 vakantiedagen, 6,5 ADV-dagen en 1 extra feestdag per kalenderjaar, op basis van een 40-urige werkweek;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">8% vakantiegeld, een pensioenregeling en (als je meer dan 10 km van het kantoor woont) een reiskostenvergoeding;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">We hechten veel waarde aan mentaal welzijn, in samenwerking met onze partner OpenUp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Geweldige extra's zoals: een jaarlijks fitnessbudget, elke dag een vers bereide gezonde lunch, snacks, tweewekelijkse borrels in de middag, XL-borrels om de drie maanden en nog veel meer.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/youngones/qa-engineer-nl-breda-74273","tags":["Development"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Breda, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1795793486},{"slug":"senior-controls-engineer-gorinchem-253177","company_name":"AMF Bakery Systems B.V.","title":"Senior Controls Engineer","description":"<p><br></p><p>Voor onze afdeling Controls Engineering in Gorinchem zijn we per direct op zoek naar een ervaren <strong>Senior</strong> <strong>Controls Engineer</strong> voor het programmeren van de aansturing van onze nieuwste voedselproductie lijnen voor onze klanten van het merk Tromp uit Gorinchem. Dit betreft een full time functie, met veel afwisseling en hulp van betrokken teamgenoten om de meest slimme/ efficiënte besturingsoplossingen te bouwen.<br><br></p><p>Ontwerp en programmeer jij graag de nieuwste deegverwerkingsmachines van AMF Bakery Systems? Step dan in als Senior Controls Engineer! Heb je ervaring als software, controls of mechatronica engineer in machinebouw, ben je vertrouwd met programmeren in structured text en ben je bekend met Siemens besturingstechniek? Hecht je aan betrokken en slimme collega's waarmee je samen 'state of the art' voedselproductielijnen ontwerpt, programmeert en bouwt? Super, dan zijn we op zoek naar jou!<br><br></p><p><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong></p><ul><li><p>Maandsalaris tussen <strong>€4.00,00 en €5.800,00</strong> o.b.v. 40 uur; afhankelijk van jouw kennis en ervaring, <strong>excl. toeslagen</strong></p></li><li><p>Reiskostenvergoeding (€0,25 / km); vitaliteitsbudget tot €25,00 netto per maand en een zeer goede pensioenvoorziening (PME)</p></li><li><p>Flexibele werktijden, deels thuiswerken mogelijk</p></li><li><p>Vakantiegeld 8%</p></li><li><p><strong>CAO Metalektro</strong> waaronder <strong>27 vakantiedagen en 13 adv dagen</strong> per jaar</p></li><li><p>Winstdeling, afhankelijk van de winst betreffende het jaar, tot max. €2.000,00 </p></li><li><p>Uitstekende opleidingsmogelijkheden zodat jouw vakkennis up to date is en blijft</p></li><li><p>Werken in een enthousiast en innoverend team</p></li><li><p>Informele werksfeer, teamuitjes, vrijdagmiddagborrel</p></li><li><p>Alle ruimte om te groeien in je functie afhankelijk van jouw ambities</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Wat ga je doen:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Ontwikkelen / programmeren, configureren en integreren van software van onze machines (PLC + HMI). We passen veel techniek toe van Siemens en Allen Bradley.</p></li><li><p>Testen op locatie Gorinchem (IO, netwerk, drives, functioneel)</p></li><li><p>Softwarematig helpen met voorbereiden van productielijnen voor de FAT</p></li><li><p>Inzetten van jouw software expertise voor ondersteuning van Assembly, Buitendienst en aan klanten bij complexe software gerelateerde issues</p></li><li><p>Incidenteel naar de klant voor ondersteuning van commissioning van nieuwe productie lijnen</p></li><li><p>Als onze software expert werk je intensief samen met Electrical en Mechanical engineers, collega's van Sales, Projectmanagers, Assembly Engineers etc. Je bent dan vraagbaak en neemt besluiten mbt onze software oplossingen.</p></li><li><p>Bijdragen aan het continue verder verbeteren van onze technische controls oplossingen conform onze Markel Business aanpak</p></li><li><p>Helpen met verder standaardiseren van onze software oplossingen van onze product portfolio van het merk Tromp in Gorinchem.</p></li><li><p>Je werkt zelfstandig aan jouw projecten</p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p>HBO Elektrotechniek, Mechatronica of vergelijkbaar, of ROC Mechatronica niv 4 met ruime ervaring</p></li><li><p>Gedegen kennis van en ervaring met Siemens Tia Portal en of Allen Bradley Studio 5000</p></li><li><p>Kennis van hogere programmeertalen (vb. Structured text of VBA)</p></li><li><p>Teamplayer, pragmatisch en leergierig</p></li><li><p>Communicatief vaardig (goede beheersing van de Nederlandse en Engelse taal)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong>In wat voor bedrijf kom jij te werken?</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;">Bij AMF Bakery Systems ben je onderdeel van een hechte en trotse groep collega’s die wereldwijd bijdraagt aan het succes van industriële bakkerijen. Wat ons verbindt, is onze drive om te innoveren én onze zorg voor de wereld om ons heen. Zo ontwikkelden wij samen de eerste industriële oven op waterstof – een grote stap richting een duurzamere toekomst.</p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">We werken met ruim 220 collega’s in Nederland – vanuit Gorinchem, Amersfoort en Nieuwleusen – en maken deel uit van de internationale Markel Food Group. Binnen AMF voelt iedereen zich thuis: of je nu op kantoor werkt, in de werkplaats of bij de klant op locatie. We geloven dat we samen sterker zijn als iedereen zich welkom, gehoord en gewaardeerd voelt.</p><p style="text-align:start;">Diversiteit en inclusie zitten dan ook in ons DNA. We staan open voor mensen met verschillende achtergronden en ideeën, omdat we weten dat juist die mix leidt tot slimme oplossingen en sterke teams. Jij hoort erbij – precies zoals je bent.</p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;">Samen bouwen we aan iets groters dan alleen machines. We bouwen aan een toekomst waarin we samen kunnen groeien, leren en impact maken.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>👉 Is deze functie perfect voor jou?</p><p>Neem dan voor meer informatie contact op met Jan Peter Westland van bureau Staal Verbind ( <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- | +31 (0)6  12 93 28 13. </strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><em>De werving en selectie voor deze vacature wordt verzorgd door bureau Staal Verbind. Reacties en sollicitaties graag via dit bureau. Ongevraagd aangeboden cv’s van andere bureaus worden niet in behandeling </em>genomen.</strong> </p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/amf-bakery-systems-bv/senior-controls-engineer-gorinchem-253177","tags":["Electrical Engineering"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Gorinchem, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1795793486},{"slug":"digital-channel-manager-kiosk-amsterdam-zuidoost-206851","company_name":"KFC Nederland (CFE)","title":"Digital Channel Manager (Kiosk)","description":"<p class="MsoNormal">Wil jij werken voor een fantastisch merk waar je direct impact kunt maken? Ben jij een digital marketing professional met een passie voor food en retail, en voel jij je thuis in een internationale omgeving? Dan is dit jouw kans.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat is jouw bijdrage aan het succes van KFC?</strong><br>Jij bent verantwoordelijk voor het commerciële succes en de continue optimalisatie van het kiosk-kanaal van KFC Nederland. Met behulp van data-analyse, klantinzichten en nauwe samenwerking met verschillende teams zorg je voor meer gebruik van de kiosken, hogere omzet, betere conversie en een hogere gemiddelde besteding per gast.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Jouw volgende uitdaging begint hier</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Als Digital Channel Manager (Kiosk) maak je deel uit van het Digital Team van KFC en speel je een belangrijke rol in onze digitale toekomst. Jij bent de drijvende kracht achter de commerciële prestaties en voortdurende optimalisatie van onze self-service kiosken in de restaurants.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je pakt nieuwe zaken snel op, bent nieuwsgierig van aard en weet klant- en prestatiegegevens moeiteloos te vertalen naar heldere acties en verbeteringen.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><ul><li><p>Je bent eigenaar van één van KFC's belangrijkste digitale verkoopkanalen en hét aanspreekpunt voor alles rondom de kiosken. Je monitort en verbetert het gebruik, de omzet, conversie en de gemiddelde besteding per gast.</p></li><li><p>Je creëert een eenvoudige, snelle en intuïtieve klantreis, terwijl je tegelijkertijd zorgt voor gebruiksgemak voor onze restaurantteams.</p></li><li><p>Je stelt business requirements op, coördineert testtrajecten en ondersteunt de implementatie van verbeteringen aan de kiosken in samenwerking met het regionale productteam, IT, Operations en technologiepartners.</p></li><li><p>Je signaleert kansen om prestaties te verbeteren door dashboards te monitoren en nauw samen te werken met Commercial Finance. Inzichten vertaal je naar concrete acties.</p></li><li><p>Je verhoogt de conversie door middel van A/B-testen, analyses van klantgedrag en continue optimalisatie van de kiosk-ervaring en productpresentatie.</p></li><li><p>Je zorgt ervoor dat campagnes, producten en waardeproposities effectief worden gepresenteerd en correct worden gelanceerd op de kiosken. Daarbij optimaliseer je de menustructuur, productzichtbaarheid en upsell- en cross-sellmogelijkheden.</p></li><li><p>Je houdt platformproblemen in de gaten en werkt samen met IT en technologiepartners om deze op te lossen.</p></li><li><p>Je werkt intensief samen met Operations om het gebruik van de kiosken en de uitvoering in de restaurants te verbeteren. Daarnaast werk je nauw samen met collega's van Digital, Brand, Innovation, IT, Commercial en externe partners.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Over KFC Nederland</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Kentucky Fried Chicken, de Amerikaanse restaurantketen gespecialiseerd in fried chicken, is sinds 1972 actief in Nederland. Inmiddels telt Nederland 96 KFC-restaurants. Dagelijks bereiden onze chefs verse kip- en vegetarische gerechten volgens het originele recept uit 1939 van oprichter Colonel Harland Sanders. Naast de focus op onze producten en de verdere groei van ons restaurantnetwerk, investeren we volop in de ontwikkeling van onze medewerkers.</p> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat breng jij mee?</strong></p><ul><li><p>Een afgeronde hbo- of wo-opleiding in Marketing, Bedrijfskunde, Digital Commerce of een vergelijkbare richting is een pré, aangevuld met minimaal 3 tot 5 jaar ervaring in het beheren of optimaliseren van een digitaal klantkanaal.</p></li><li><p>Sterke analytische vaardigheden en ervaring met het monitoren van dashboards, het vertalen van data naar inzichten en acties, en het uitvoeren van A/B-testen.</p></li><li><p>Ervaring met het verbeteren van klantreizen, digitale interfaces en online merchandising.</p></li><li><p>Sterke projectmanagement- en stakeholdermanagementvaardigheden, met het vermogen om mensen te beïnvloeden zonder hiërarchische verantwoordelijkheid.</p></li><li><p>Een gestructureerde, proactieve en hands-on werkstijl, gecombineerd met een pragmatische en samenwerkingsgerichte aanpak.</p></li><li><p>Nieuwsgierigheid en de drive om continu te testen, leren en verbeteren.</p></li><li><p>Ervaring binnen restaurants, retail of QSR (Quick Service Restaurants) is een pré.</p></li><li><p>Uitstekende beheersing van zowel de Nederlandse als Engelse taal, mondeling en schriftelijk.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Voldoe je niet aan alle eisen? Geen probleem!</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Onderzoek laat zien dat mensen vaak pas solliciteren wanneer zij aan vrijwel alle functie-eisen voldoen. Bij Collins Foods kijken we niet alleen naar ervaring, maar ook naar potentieel en ambitie.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Word jij enthousiast van deze rol? Dan horen we graag van je. Misschien ben jij precies het talent dat wij zoeken.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat bieden wij jou?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Bij ons krijg je de kans om echt impact te maken binnen een internationale, dynamische en groeiende organisatie. Je komt terecht in een hecht team waar initiatief, ondernemerschap en creativiteit worden gewaardeerd én verwacht.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Daarnaast kun je rekenen op:</p><ul><li><p>Veel vrijheid om je rol vorm te geven en jouw ideeën werkelijkheid te maken.</p></li><li><p>Vanaf dag één verantwoordelijkheid en eigenaarschap.</p></li><li><p>Een aantrekkelijk salaris afhankelijk van jouw kennis en ervaring.</p></li><li><p>Een prestatiegerichte bonusregeling.</p></li><li><p>Uitgebreide mogelijkheden voor persoonlijke ontwikkeling.</p></li><li><p>Een uitstekende pensioenregeling.</p></li><li><p>Een laptop en telefoon van de zaak.</p></li><li><p>8% vakantiegeld.</p></li><li><p>27 vakantiedagen.</p></li><li><p>Reiskostenvergoeding.</p></li><li><p>Personeelskorting op KFC-producten en deelname aan bedrijfsfitnessprogramma's.</p></li><li><p>Mogelijkheid om hybride te werken.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Klaar om impact te maken?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Zie jij jezelf in deze rol en wil jij meebouwen aan de digitale toekomst van KFC? Solliciteer dan vandaag nog. We kijken ernaar uit om je te ontmoeten!</p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Vragen?</strong><br>Neem contact op met <strong>Sanne Gehner (Talent Acquisition Specialist)</strong> via <strong>+31 6 10906491</strong>.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Volg ons ook op LinkedIn en blijf op de hoogte van onze vacatures en ontwikkelingen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/kfc-nederland-cfe/digital-channel-manager-kiosk-amsterdam-zuidoost-206851","tags":["Hoofdkantoor"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Amsterdam Zuidoost, Noord-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1795793482},{"slug":"senior-intershop-technical-architect-amsterdam-27120","company_name":"Vmlenterprisesolutions","title":"Senior Intershop Technical Architect ","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Intershop Technical Architect with deep, hands-on ICM experience and strong enterprise architecture expertise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will lead the architecture, development and delivery of B2B/B2C commerce solutions on Intershop ICM 14, while also contributing to broader technology initiatives involving microservices, event-driven architecture, API management and cloud-native applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role combining solution architecture, technical leadership, engineering guidance and stakeholder collaboration across Intershop and non-Intershop projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the technical architecture of our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intershop ICM solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, working across B2B commerce, integrations and modern cloud-native applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Intershop architecture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Own solution design across ICM, B2B capabilities, PWA/headless implementations, extensions and custom business logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the solution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Lead discovery and fit-gap assessments, deciding what should be configured, customised or built as a standalone service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect the ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Design integrations between Intershop and ERP, OMS, CRM, PIM, pricing, payment and other enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect beyond Intershop:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Guide microservices, APIs, event-driven integrations and cloud-native applications across commerce and non-commerce projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set technical direction:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Define API, integration and security standards, and guide engineering teams through architecture and code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn requirements into delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Translate business needs into technical designs, estimates, architecture documentation and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the technical conversation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Work directly with client architects, stakeholders, business analysts, engineers, Cloud and DevOps teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep us moving forward:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Identify practical opportunities to use AI, automation and modern engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most important thing for us is&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;deep, hands-on Intershop experience combined with the ability to lead architecture at enterprise scale.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years in software engineering&lt;/strong&gt;, including significant solution architecture experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years working hands-on with Intershop&lt;/strong&gt;, with strong knowledge of ICM architecture, customisation, extensions and Intershop PWA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;at least two Intershop implementations into production&lt;/strong&gt;, including&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;one greenfield implementation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intershop B2B commerce&lt;/strong&gt;, including headless architecture, REST APIs, search, catalogue management and customer-specific pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;expertise, ideally Java 17+, plus object-oriented design, enterprise application development and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven architecture experience across&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;microservices, distributed systems and enterprise integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence leading technical discussions with clients and guiding distributed engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
