&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bonus points:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-driven architecture, asynchronous communication and messaging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST API design, OpenAPI, API gateways and OAuth2/OIDC.&lt;/li&gt;
