&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nebius/delivery-director-amsterdam-403899","tags":["PMO-CX"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1795751719},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-fulfilment-amsterdam-439587","company_name":"Nivoda","title":"Senior Product Manager, Fulfilment","description":"<h2>About Nivoda</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nivoda is the operating system for the global jewellery industry. Our marketplace connects jewellers with suppliers of diamonds, gemstones, melee and finished jewellery in 70+ countries, with more than $300M in annual transactions and a $350B industry still waiting to be modernised. We are scaling fast, and we are only getting started.<br /></p><h2>Our Mission</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">For decades, the diamond trade has been slow, opaque and inefficient: hard to find stock, hard to trust prices, hard to know when anything will arrive. Nivoda exists to change that. We give businesses of every size, in every location, the same access to inventory, the same transparent pricing and the same reliable delivery as the biggest players in the industry.<br /></p><h2>The Fulfilment &amp; Express Team</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Fulfilment &amp; Express team is where Nivoda's promise to buyers is kept. We own how an order travels from supplier to jeweller: the delivery date we promise, the hubs that hold and check stock, the carriers that move it, and the returns and quality checks that protect every purchase. We are a remote-first team of product, engineering, design and QA who work closely with Operations, Customer Support, Sales and Supplier Experience. We are low on hierarchy and high on ownership, and we like solving problems where software meets the physical world.<br /></p><h2>About the Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Senior Product Manager for Fulfilment &amp; Express, you will own how Nivoda orders get from supplier to jeweller: accurately promised, reliably tracked and delivered fast. You will set the strategy and roadmap for a complex, operationally heavy product area that spans diamonds, gemstones, melee and finished jewellery, with physical hubs, carriers and suppliers behind every screen. Your work decides whether a jeweller trusts Nivoda with their next order, so this is a role with real commercial impact and plenty of room to lead.<br /></p><h2>What would YOU be doing?</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Setting the fulfilment strategy for the next 2 to 4 quarters, making trade-offs explicit, including what we are choosing not to do and why</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owning the roadmap and the numbers: running quarterly planning, sizing opportunities and setting targets for delivery-as-promised, delivery date accuracy and delivery speed</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Making our Promised Delivery Dates trustworthy by rolling out SLA-based, dynamic delivery dates across every category and route, and shaping how they are used for delay communications and, in time, shown to buyers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scaling Express, our hub-based fast-delivery offer, including hub workflows (receiving, inventory and RFID put/pick, QC and dispatch), ready-to-wear jewellery, consignment flows and speed options such as same-day pickup</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owning jewellery returns and on-platform QC, from the manufacturer through to the hub, including hallmarking and consignment returns to suppliers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Improving the delivery experience through carrier and rate/transit integrations, consolidation, last-mile cost and efficiency, and clear order visibility for buyers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translating hub operations, carrier behaviour, customs and supplier handling into clear product requirements, designing for the exceptions as much as the happy path</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turning support tickets, delay breaches, supplier performance data and customer feedback into prioritised problems, then deciding what to build, buy or fix operationally</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partnering daily with Engineering and Design, and closely with Operations, Customer Support, Account Management, Sales, Supplier Experience and Fintech so delivery, credit and payments feel like one journey for the buyer</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Writing sharp PRDs and decision records, and reporting progress openly through our weekly updates</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentoring other product managers and designers on working in operationally complex domains<br /></p></li></ul><h2> What do we need from YOU?</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5 to 8 years in product management, including experience owning a complex product area end to end</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in fulfilment, logistics, supply chain or other operations-heavy products. You are comfortable where software meets warehouses, carriers, SLAs and customs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong systems thinking: you can map a multi-party process, find where promises break, and design for failure modes, delays and edge cases</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Data fluency: you define the right metrics, query and interrogate data yourself (Snowflake, Mixpanel or similar) and use it to decide what to build next</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound prioritisation and commercial judgement: you weigh impact, effort and risk honestly, say no clearly, and can explain the return on a fulfilment investment to leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent cross-functional leadership: you build trust with engineers, operators and commercial teams, and influence without authority across time zones</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear written communication: concise PRDs, roadmaps and updates that make decisions easy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customer and operator empathy, and high agency: you spend time with jewellers, support teams and hub operators, you take ownership, and you follow things through to the outcome<br /></p></li></ul><h2> Nice to have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Jewellery, diamond or luxury goods experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Marketplace or B2B commerce experience, ideally two-sided with supply and demand constraints</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with carrier or shipping APIs, rate and transit tools, 3PL integrations, inventory systems or RFID</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building predictive or SLA-based estimates, such as delivery dates or ETAs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with cross-border shipping, customs, duties or compliance (for example hallmarking and HS codes)</p></li></ul><h2><br />Our culture and what we offer</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nivoda is collaborative, high-growth and built on empowerment. You will have real ownership from day one, a team that wants you to succeed, and the chance to keep learning as the company scales. We are remote-first with flexible hours, and we trust you to do your best work your way.</p><h2><br />Our current benefits</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">⏰ Flexible working hours and a vibrant company culture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🏡 Remote work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🩺 Private health insurance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">📚 Opportunities for growth and learning</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">💳 Flexible compensation card (meals, transport, childcare)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌴 Unlimited holiday allowance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🚀 The chance to join during an exponential expansion phase</p></li></ul><h2><br />Equal opportunity</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nivoda is committed to building a diverse and inclusive team, and we welcome applications from everyone. Even if you do not meet 100% of our musts, do not let it stop you. If this role excites you, we would love to hear from you.</p><hr><p>Compensation: $180K – $225K • Offers Equity</p><ul><li> • $180K – $225K • Offers Equity</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nivoda/senior-product-manager-fulfilment-amsterdam-439587","tags":["Product"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1795740013},{"slug":"senior-devops-engineer-den-haag-212266","company_name":"Lefebvre Sdu","title":"Senior DevOps Engineer","description":"<p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Legal AI is zo goed als de kennis erachter, en aan die kennis bouwen we bij Lefebvre Sdu al 200 jaar. Dag in, dag uit. Wet voor wet. Woord voor woord. Dat doen we zo zorgvuldig dat andere legal AI-tools op onze data en software draaien. Vanuit ons Nederlandse kantoor bouwen we daarnaast voor Lefebvre Group, de Europese leider in juridische en fiscale kennis, ons eigen platform: GenIA-L, dat in Europa inmiddels goed is voor meer dan 100 miljoen euro ARR. Ruim 75.000 professionals werken er dagelijks mee, en we bouwen het op de standaard die hun vak vraagt. We zoeken een Senior DevOps Engineer die zorgt dat alles wat we bouwen veilig en soepel live gaat.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>HOE JIJ ONS VERDER BRENGT</strong></p><p>GenIA-L schuift steeds verder het dagelijkse werk van juristen en fiscalisten in, en dat vraagt om een platform dat soepel meebeweegt. Onze developers willen snel bouwen en veilig live gaan, zonder uren kwijt te zijn aan pipelines en repository-setup. Daar zorg jij voor. Onze infrastructuur draait op AWS, met Kubernetes via EKS, Terraform en Helm, en onze CI/CD loopt via GitHub Actions. In die pipelines borg jij bij elke release de secure coding-eisen van ISO 27001, van SAST en security scanning tot code quality checks en de OWASP Top 10. Nu ligt DevOps nog bij een extern team van 4 engineers. Binnen een jaar willen we die kennis volledig zelf in huis hebben, en daarin speel jij een hoofdrol. Je wordt het eerste aanspreekpunt voor de developers in Product &amp; Technology, brengt structuur in hoe het team werkt en bouwt mee aan de volgende stappen, zoals de overstap van Helm naar ArgoCD. Je weet dat het gelukt is als de andere teams merkbaar minder tijd kwijt zijn aan hun deployments, de infrastructuur gezond is en je precies ziet wat er gebeurt. En als DevOps voelt als een vanzelfsprekend onderdeel van Product &amp; Technology. De stack staat en de ambitie is helder. Wat nu nog ontbreekt, is het team dat dit zelf gaat dragen, en dat bouw jij mee op.</p> <br> <p><strong>DIT ZOEKEN WIJ</strong></p><p>Je bent een DevOps engineer die het liefst dicht bij de developers zit. Je bouwt een platform waar anderen zelf mee verder kunnen, vindt het vanzelfsprekend dat security in elke pipeline is ingebouwd en brengt graag rust en overzicht in een omgeving die in beweging is.<br>Je hebt minimaal 3 jaar hands-on ervaring met Kubernetes, idealiter met AWS EKS.</p><ul><li><p>Je hebt veel gewerkt met AWS en Infrastructure as Code.</p></li><li><p>CI/CD en containers zijn een vertrouwd onderdeel van je werk.</p></li><li><p>Je zorgt voor duidelijkheid in technische processen en afspraken.</p></li><li><p>Ervaring met het bouwen en doorontwikkelen van een softwareproduct is een pré.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>HIER TEKEN JE VOOR</strong></p><p>Je rapporteert aan onze Lead Backend Engineer en bent de vaste sparringpartner van de developers in Product &amp; Technology. Je krijgt veel vertrouwen, eigenaarschap en vrijheid, dus zie je iets wat beter moet, dan pak je het hier meestal gewoon zelf op. Daarbij is er ruimte voor een goede balans tussen werk en privé. Onze doorgroeipaden zijn nog in ontwikkeling, en omdat we tracks verwachten richting lead DevOps, principal engineering en engineering management, ben jij er vroeg bij.<br></p><ul><li><p>Goed basissalaris en een standaard werkweek van 36 uur.</p></li><li><p>Een eindejaarsuitkering van 4% van jouw bruto jaarsalaris en een variabele winstdeling die kan oplopen tot 6% van jouw bruto jaarsalaris.</p></li><li><p>23 vakantiedagen en een persoonlijk keuzebudget van 12%, waarvan 8% vakantiegeld en 4% vrij besteedbaar voor bijvoorbeeld extra vakantiedagen.</p></li><li><p>Een goede pensioenregeling via PGB, inclusief aanvullende partnerverzekering.</p></li><li><p>Een reiskostenvergoeding van €0,25 per kilometer of een OV-vergoeding, en we bieden een aantrekkelijke fietsregeling. Voor medewerkers met een reisafstand van minder dan 10 km of meer dan 60 km hebben we een aangepaste regeling.</p></li><li><p>Hybride werken: 2 dagen per week op kantoor in Den Haag, op dinsdag en donderdag.</p></li><li><p>Ruimte om te groeien. In je vak, in je rol, in de organisatie.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>MEER WETEN?</strong><br>Wij vertellen je graag alles over het team en de rol. Stuur jouw cv en je hoort binnen 2 werkdagen van ons. Eerst nog wat vragen? App of bel Nadine op 0628556265.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Een referentiecheck en een VOG horen bij het selectieproces.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/lefebvre-sdu/senior-devops-engineer-den-haag-212266","tags":["Product & Technology"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Den Haag, Zuid-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1795739493}],"links":{"first":"https://ww